  <h2>2. Not Medical Advice</h2>
  <p>The Services are provided by a wellness education company, not by licensed medical professionals. The Course content is based on publicly available research and general behavioral and lifestyle principles related to sleep. None of the content provided through the Services constitutes:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Medical advice or clinical recommendations</li>
